<!--
  Screen sharing: the phone's own screen shown on the car's (car/PhoneAppsScreen.kt, mirror/). Shown
  on a car's display and read at a glance.
-->
<resources>
    <!-- Under the title of Screen sharing, above the phone's apps to show in the car: the ways back from the
         phone's screen to myCar's own. The black bands are the empty sides of the car's picture around the
         phone's; Home, Back and Media are buttons some cars have; "Stop" is the button on the phone's
         notification while its screen is shared (service_notification_stop) -->
    <string name="car_phone_apps_way_back">Back to myCar: tap the black bands around the phone, press a button on the car (Home, Back, Media…) or tap Stop in the phone\'s notification.</string>
    <!-- Under "Touch is off. Enable myCar under Settings > Accessibility on the phone." (car_phone_apps_touch_off),
         on a car whose screen is wider than tall: without myCar under Accessibility the phone isn't turned
         on its side either -->
    <string name="car_phone_apps_upright">Until then, the phone also stays upright instead of turning to fill the car\'s screen.</string>
</resources>
